          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_polish_parade_chicago_1978",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "On May 6, 1978, during the Polish Constitution Day parade in Chicago, a dapper, middle-aged man confidently shook hands with First Lady of the United States Rosalynn Carter.",
          "src_script": "1.02#1",
          "est_duration_s": 10.52
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_secret_service_pin_handshake",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Pinned to the lapel of his tailored suit was a prestigious security clearance badge bearing the letter S, issued directly by the United States Secret Service after rigorous background screening.",
          "src_script": "1.02#2",
          "est_duration_s": 11.23
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_clown_costume_closet",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "And most admirable of all, he was known as the benevolent citizen who frequently donned the colorful costume of Pogo the Clown.",
          "src_script": "1.02#6",
          "est_duration_s": 8.4
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The mask worn by predators of this typology is not forged from secretive isolation, but woven from the conspicuous glare of social status and philanthropic charity.",
          "src_script": "1.15#2",
          "est_duration_s": 11.06
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_clown_mirror_chiaroscuro",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Within Gacy’s psychological architecture, donning the costume of Pogo the Clown or shaking hands with political elites served two vital psychic functions.",
          "src_script": "1.15#3",
          "est_duration_s": 9.46
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Second, it functioned as a cognitive self-hypnosis mechanism, allowing him to convince himself that he was a benevolent benefactor entitled to exist above all ethical and legal boundaries.",
          "src_script": "1.15#5",
          "est_duration_s": 11.86
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "H",
