          "bg": "t6_redflag_trick_handcuffs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "A pair of handcuffs and a magic trick. The deadly trap that claimed 33 lives.",
          "src_script": "hook — không phải dữ kiện kịch bản",
          "est_duration_s": 5.82
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The crime scene evidence allowed us to draw a sharp demarcation between John Wayne Gacy’s evolving “Modus Operandi” and his immutable “Psychological Signature”:",
          "src_script": "2.09#1",
          "est_duration_s": 9.8
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_pharmacy_counters_renovation",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Regarding his Modus Operandi MO: He continually adapted his techniques over time to facilitate control and ensure escape.",
          "src_script": "2.09#2",
          "est_duration_s": 7.8
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_pharmacy_counters_renovation",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "He lured young victims with promises of lucrative construction jobs, plying them with alcohol and marijuana to disarm their physical defenses.",
          "src_script": "2.09#3",
          "est_duration_s": 9.0
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_redflag_trick_handcuffs",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "He then performed a sleight-of-hand trick called the “handcuff trick”, tricking victims into letting themselves be handcuffed under the guise of demonstrating an escape, before locking them in complete helplessness.",
          "src_script": "2.09#4",
          "est_duration_s": 12.6
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Conversely, his psychological “Signature” remained permanently unaltered:",
          "src_script": "2.09#5",
          "est_duration_s": 3.5
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_highschool_ring_jas",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "It was the retention of morbid trophies, such as class rings, wallets, and driver's licenses, to rekindle his fantasy addiction whenever he gazed upon them.",
          "src_script": "2.09#7",
          "est_duration_s": 10.7
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_crawlspace_trapdoor_opened",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "And most macabre of all, it was choosing the crawl space directly beneath his own home as a burial ground, allowing him to walk daily above the bodies of those whose lives he had extinguished.",
          "src_script": "2.09#8",
          "est_duration_s": 14.7
        },
        {
