        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_gas_station_neon_midnight",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Two unmarked surveillance cruisers tracked Gacy’s Oldsmobile relentlessly from early morning hours until late into the freezing night.",
          "src_script": "2.10#4",
          "est_duration_s": 6.98
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_diner_booth_confrontation",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "On bitterly cold winter nights, he pulled over, walked up to the unmarked patrol cars, and casually invited the trailing officers to join him for dinner inside restaurants.",
          "src_script": "2.10#8",
          "est_duration_s": 10.52
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_diner_booth_confrontation",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "He laughed boisterously, buying them rounds of beer and declaring boldly: “I know you guys are doing your job, but you are never going to find anything on me.”",
          "src_script": "2.10#9",
          "est_duration_s": 10.98
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Buying drinks and brazenly mocking the investigators is an extreme manifestation of “Power Compensation” in malignant narcissists.",
          "src_script": "2.11#1",
          "est_duration_s": 7.47
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_police_entry_summerdale",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "For Gacy, being shadowed by an entire police detail did not induce dread of punishment, but triggered an intoxicating adrenaline rush.",
          "src_script": "2.11#2",
          "est_duration_s": 9.07
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_diner_booth_confrontation",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "He viewed law enforcement officers as a captive audience compelled to witness his intellectual superiority.",
          "src_script": "2.11#3",
          "est_duration_s": 6.68
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "By actively manipulating the emotions of his pursuers, the predator reaffirmed his delusion that he remained untouchable and in total command.",
          "src_script": "2.11#4",
          "est_duration_s": 9.07
        },
        {
