        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_forensic_trowel_damp_soil",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "With the very first shovelful of dirt, a detective’s hand unearthed fabric fragments and human skeletal remains buried in the cold ground.",
          "src_script": "3.08#1",
          "est_duration_s": 8.4
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t6_crawlspace_trapdoor_opened",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Directly beneath the warm living room where Gacy entertained guests, directly beneath the bedroom where he rested each night, lay a mass subterranean cemetery of innocent young lives.",
          "src_script": "3.08#3",
          "est_duration_s": 10.52
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_flashlight_beam_lime_dust",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "A total of twenty-six victims were found buried in the cramped crawl space beneath the house.",
          "src_script": "3.10#4",
          "est_duration_s": 7.1
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_gacy_house_daylight_winter",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "How could a human being live placidly for years directly atop the graves of nearly thirty victims he had personally murdered?",
          "src_script": "3.11#1",
          "est_duration_s": 9.07
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t6_psychological_mask_metaphor",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "The explanation lies in the extreme pathological mechanism of “Cognitive Compartmentalization” within the psychopathic brain.",
          "src_script": "3.11#2",
          "est_duration_s": 6.68
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
